            "review_title": "Review at Nha Trang Seafoods",
            "review_text": "Lee Won C\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia23 contributions\n0\nJuicy prawns\nJan 2020 • Family\nWe enjoyed the prawns best. Juicy and delicately done. Other dishes were generally alright - fish, fried rice and glass noodles. We were however served with 3 dishes first and had to wait a good 15 minutes for our next 2 dishes to arrive. It was our first stop in Nha Trang (just landed) and we were needing time to order — the head waiter was not particularly warm or friendly.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 2, 2020",
