            "review_text": "Amber Y\n2 contributions\n0\nFood Gem\nOct 2018 • Family\nWe came here yesterday. The restaurant may not look as appearing but please do not be deceived by its appearance coz we are here for good Vietnamese food! We ordered pan fried tiger prawn and it was awesome! It served in a plate of 10 pieces for 210.d. Really worth the price. We also ordered a beef salad that the spicy taste was just perfect for us! I would recommend this restaurant to those who are after great food at good prices! My only advice is that only order from the page with prices. Do not order from the page of “today’s price” because you will be charged a lot, and getting the same stuff as priced.\nRead more\nWritten October 23, 2018",
