            "review_text": "siegelg\nNha Trang, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nExcellent experience\nApr 2018 • Couples\nRecommended by our guide my wife and I decided to give it a try. We were thrilled with the food and the service. Most of the menu had English explanation and if not then there were pictures of dishes. We had some of the best clams (Thailand style) ever!! Also fresh steamed spinach in oyster sauce as well as a noodle dish with lots of vegetables. I had a Diet Coke and when they could not understand my wife’s request for soda water they took her in to the kitchen where the refrigerator was and let her pick it out. Service was terrific as was the food. The whole meal came to about 18$ US.!! And we couldn’t finish everything. We highly recommend this spot. Enjoy!!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 19, 2018",
